{"code":"pa","name":"Punjabi","native":"ਪੰਜਾਬੀ","phase":2,"medium":"en","file_level":"A1","pronunciation":[{"t":"Punjabi is TONAL — pitch changes meaning!","r":"tone","tip":"ਘੋੜਾ (kòṛā, low tone) = horse vs ਕੋਰਾ (kórā, high) = blank! Listen and copy the melody!"},{"t":"ਘ ਝ ਢ ਧ ਭ create LOW tone","r":"low tone","tip":"ਭਰਾ (prà) = brother. Breathe the letter, drop the pitch!"},{"t":"ਹ creates HIGH tone around it","r":"high tone","tip":"ਹਰਾ (árā) = green. H whispers, tone rises!"},{"t":"ਟ ਠ ਡ ਢ ਣ curl the tongue BACK","r":"ṭa ṭha ḍa ḍha ṇa","tip":"ਟਮਾਟਰ (ṭamāṭar) = tomato. Roof-of-mouth sounds!"},{"t":"ੰ/ਂਂ nasalise the vowel","r":"~n","tip":"ਮੈਂ (mãĩ) = I, ਹਾਂ (hã) = am. Hum it!"}],"alphabet":{"title":"Gurmukhi: vowels + consonants","explain":"Punjabi uses Gurmukhi (from the Guru's mouth!), written left-to-right with a headline bar! Vowels first, then consonant families. Vowel signs join: ਕ + ਾ = ਕਾ!","letters":[{"t":"ਅ","r":"a (short)"},{"t":"ਆ","r":"ā (long a)"},{"t":"ਇ","r":"i (short)"},{"t":"ਈ","r":"ī (long ee)"},{"t":"ਉ","r":"u (short)"},{"t":"ਊ","r":"ū (long oo)"},{"t":"ਏ","r":"e (eh)"},{"t":"ਐ","r":"ai"},{"t":"ਓ","r":"o (oh)"},{"t":"ਔ","r":"au"},{"t":"ਕ","r":"ka"},{"t":"ਖ","r":"kha"},{"t":"ਗ","r":"ga"},{"t":"ਘ","r":"gha (low tone)"},{"t":"ਙ","r":"ṅa"},{"t":"ਚ","r":"cha"},{"t":"ਛ","r":"chha"},{"t":"ਜ","r":"ja"},{"t":"ਝ","r":"jha (low tone)"},{"t":"ਞ","r":"ña"},{"t":"ਟ","r":"ṭa (retroflex)"},{"t":"ਠ","r":"ṭha"},{"t":"ਡ","r":"ḍa"},{"t":"ਢ","r":"ḍha (low tone)"},{"t":"ਣ","r":"ṇa"},{"t":"ਤ","r":"ta (dental)"},{"t":"ਥ","r":"tha"},{"t":"ਦ","r":"da"},{"t":"ਧ","r":"dha (low tone)"},{"t":"ਨ","r":"na"},{"t":"ਪ","r":"pa"},{"t":"ਫ","r":"pha"},{"t":"ਬ","r":"ba"},{"t":"ਭ","r":"bha (low tone)"},{"t":"ਮ","r":"ma"},{"t":"ਯ","r":"ya"},{"t":"ਰ","r":"ra (flapped)"},{"t":"ਲ","r":"la"},{"t":"ਵ","r":"va/wa"},{"t":"ੜ","r":"ṛa (flapped retroflex)"},{"t":"ਸ","r":"sa"},{"t":"ਹ","r":"ha (high tone)"}]},"counting":{"title":"Counting 0 to 100","explain":"Punjabi numbers 1–20 are unique — learn them by heart! Tens then fuse: ਇੱਕੀ = 21. 100 = ਸੌ! ਵਾਹ!","numbers":[{"t":"ਸਿਫ਼ਰ","r":"sifar","en":"0"},{"t":"ਇੱਕ","r":"ikk","en":"1"},{"t":"ਦੋ","r":"do","en":"2"},{"t":"ਤਿੰਨ","r":"tinn","en":"3"},{"t":"ਚਾਰ","r":"chār","en":"4"},{"t":"ਪੰਜ","r":"panj","en":"5"},{"t":"ਛੇ","r":"chhe","en":"6"},{"t":"ਸੱਤ","r":"satt","en":"7"},{"t":"ਅੱਠ","r":"aṭṭh","en":"8"},{"t":"ਨੌਂ","r":"naun","en":"9"},{"t":"ਦਸ","r":"das","en":"10"},{"t":"ਗਿਆਰਾਂ","r":"giārān","en":"11"},{"t":"ਬਾਰਾਂ","r":"bārān","en":"12"},{"t":"ਤੇਰਾਂ","r":"terān","en":"13"},{"t":"ਚੌਦਾਂ","r":"chaudān","en":"14"},{"t":"ਪੰਦਰਾਂ","r":"pandarān","en":"15"},{"t":"ਸੋਲ਼ਾਂ","r":"solān","en":"16"},{"t":"ਸਤਾਰਾਂ","r":"satārān","en":"17"},{"t":"ਅਠਾਰਾਂ","r":"aṭhārān","en":"18"},{"t":"ਉਨੀ","r":"unnī","en":"19"},{"t":"ਵੀਹ","r":"vīh","en":"20"},{"t":"ਤੀਹ","r":"tīh","en":"30"},{"t":"ਚਾਲੀ","r":"chālī","en":"40"},{"t":"ਪੰਜਾਹ","r":"panjāh","en":"50"},{"t":"ਸੱਠ","r":"saṭṭh","en":"60"},{"t":"ਸੱਤਰ","r":"sattar","en":"70"},{"t":"ਅੱਸੀ","r":"assī","en":"80"},{"t":"ਨੱਬੇ","r":"nabbe","en":"90"},{"t":"ਸੌ","r":"sau","en":"100"}],"rules":["1–20 are unique: ਇੱਕ, ਦੋ, ਤਿੰਨ… ਵੀਹ — memorise them.","21+ fuses: ਇੱਕੀ (21), ਬਾਈ (22). Double letters (ੱ) = hold the sound!"]},"level":{"title":"Starter: greetings, ਹੈ, first verbs","goals":["Greet people and introduce yourself","Use ਹੈ, ਇਹ/ਉਹ and plurals","Use present verbs and say 'I have'"],"units":[{"id":"A1-U1","title":"First words","lessons":[{"id":"A1-U1-L1","title":"Greetings: ਸਤਿ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਕਾਲ","learn":"ਸਤਿ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਕਾਲ (God is truth — the Sikh greeting for ALL!). Meeting: ਮੈਂ + name + ਹਾਂ → ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ ਮਿਲ ਕੇ ਖੁਸ਼ੀ ਹੋਈ (happy to meet you)! Fold hands: ਫਤਿਹ!","vocab":[{"t":"ਸਤਿ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਕਾਲ","r":"sati srī akāl","en":"hello (God is truth)","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"ਨਮਸਤੇ","r":"namaste","en":"hello","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"ਸ਼ੁਭ ਸਵੇਰ","r":"shubh saver","en":"good morning","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"ਸ਼ੁਭ ਸ਼ਾਮ","r":"shubh shām","en":"good evening","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"ਸ਼ੁਕਰੀਆ","r":"shukrīā","en":"thank you","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"ਮੁਆਫ਼ ਕਰੋ","r":"muāf karo","en":"sorry / excuse me","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"ਹਾਂ","r":"hān","en":"yes","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"ਨਹੀਂ","r":"nahīn","en":"no / not","pos":"phrase"}],"grammar":{"title":"ਮੈਂXਹਾਂ + ਖੁਸ਼ੀ ਹੋਈ","explain":"ਮੈਂ ਸਿਮਰਨ ਹਾਂ = I am Simran. ਹਾਂ = am (only for ਮੈਂ!). ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ ਮਿਲ ਕੇ ਖੁਸ਼ੀ ਹੋਈ = meeting-you brought joy!","pattern":"ਮੈਂ + name + ਹਾਂ","examples":[{"t":"ਸਤਿ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਕਾਲ, ਮੈਂ ਸਿਮਰਨ ਹਾਂ।","r":"sati srī akāl, main Simran hān.","en":"Hello, I am Simran."},{"t":"ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ ਮਿਲ ਕੇ ਖੁਸ਼ੀ ਹੋਈ!","r":"tuhānū mil ke khushī hoī!","en":"Nice to meet you!"},{"t":"ਸ਼ੁਕਰੀਆ!","r":"shukrīā!","en":"Thanks!"}],"mistakes":["Saying ਮੈਂ ਹਾਂ ਹਾਂ — one ਹਾਂ only!","Saying ਤੂੰ to elders — use ਤੁਸੀਂ!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ਸਿਮਰਨ","t":"ਸਤਿ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਕਾਲ, ਮੈਂ ਸਿਮਰਨ ਹਾਂ।","r":"sati srī akāl, main Simran hān.","en":"Hello, I am Simran."},{"sp":"ਅਰਜੁਨ","t":"ਸਤਿ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਕਾਲ, ਮੈਂ ਅਰਜੁਨ ਹਾਂ।","r":"sati srī akāl, main Arjun hān.","en":"Hello, I am Arjun."},{"sp":"ਸਿਮਰਨ","t":"ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ ਮਿਲ ਕੇ ਖੁਸ਼ੀ ਹੋਈ!","r":"tuhānū mil ke khushī hoī!","en":"Nice to meet you!"},{"sp":"ਅਰਜੁਨ","t":"ਮੈਨੂੰ ਵੀ!","r":"mainū vī!","en":"Me too!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I am Simran","answer":"ਮੈਂ ਸਿਮਰਨ ਹਾਂ"},{"type":"fill","q":"___! (Nice to meet you)","answer":"ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ ਮਿਲ ਕੇ ਖੁਸ਼ੀ ਹੋਈ"},{"type":"choose","q":"To elders you say…","options":["ਤੂੰ","ਤੁਸੀਂ","ਤੁੰ","ਏਹ"],"answer":"ਤੁਸੀਂ"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: ਹਾਂ / ਸਿਮਰਨ / ਮੈਂ","answer":"ਮੈਂ ਸਿਮਰਨ ਹਾਂ"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: ਮੈਂ ਸਿਮਰਨ ਹਾਂ।","answer":"ਮੈਂ ਸਿਮਰਨ ਹਾਂ।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"ਸਤਿ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਕਾਲ means…","options":["goodbye","God is truth (hello)","thanks","sorry"],"answer":1,"why":"ਸਤਿ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਕਾਲ = Sikh greeting for all."},{"q":"ਖੁਸ਼ੀ ਹੋਈ phrase means…","options":["thank you","nice to meet you","excuse me","good luck"],"answer":1,"why":"Meeting-joy phrase."},{"q":"ਮੁਆਫ਼ ਕਰੋ means…","options":["thanks","sorry / excuse me","hello","yes"],"answer":1,"why":"ਮੁਆਫ਼ ਕਰੋ = sorry."},{"q":"ਮੈਨੂੰ ਵੀ means…","options":["goodbye","me too","never","maybe"],"answer":1,"why":"ਮੈਨੂੰ + ਵੀ = me-too."},{"q":"ਹਾਂ is used with…","options":["ਤੁਸੀਂ","ਮੈਂ","ਉਹ","ਏਹ"],"answer":1,"why":"ਮੈਂ + ਹਾਂ only!"}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Greetings worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Punjabi.","items":["hello (Sikh)","thank you","yes"],"key":["ਸਤਿ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਕਾਲ","ਸ਼ੁਕਰੀਆ","ਹਾਂ"]},{"instruction":"Introduce yourself.","items":["Hello, I am Simran","Nice to meet you"],"key":["ਸਤਿ ਸ੍ਰੀ ਅਕਾਲ, ਮੈਂ ਸਿਮਰਨ ਹਾਂ","ਤੁਹਾਨੂੰ ਮਿਲ ਕੇ ਖੁਸ਼ੀ ਹੋਈ"]},{"instruction":"Dayparts.","items":["good morning","good evening"],"key":["ਸ਼ੁਭ ਸਵੇਰ","ਸ਼ੁਭ ਸ਼ਾਮ"]}]}},{"id":"A1-U1-L2","title":"Names and ਤੁਸੀਂ ਕਿਵੇਂ ਹੋ","learn":"Ask names: ਤੁਹਾਡਾ ਨਾਂ ਕੀ ਹੈ? (what is your name?) → ਮੇਰਾ ਨਾਂ… How are you: ਤੁਸੀਂ ਕਿਵੇਂ ਹੋ? → ਮੈਂ ਠੀਕ ਹਾਂ! ਹਾਂ/ਹੋ/ਹੈ/ਹਨ — four BE-forms!","vocab":[{"t":"ਮੈਂ","r":"main","en":"I","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"ਤੁਸੀਂ","r":"tusīn","en":"you (formal)","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"ਨਾਂ","r":"nān","en":"name","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ਤੁਹਾਡਾ ਨਾਂ ਕੀ ਹੈ","r":"tuhāḍā nān kī hai","en":"what is your name","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"ਮੇਰਾ ਨਾਂ","r":"merā nān","en":"my name","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"ਤੁਸੀਂ ਕਿਵੇਂ ਹੋ","r":"tusīn kiven ho","en":"how are you","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"ਮੈਂ ਠੀਕ ਹਾਂ","r":"main ṭhīk hān","en":"I'm fine","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"ਕਿਰਪਾ ਕਰਕੇ","r":"kirpā karke","en":"please","pos":"phrase"}],"grammar":{"title":"ਹਾਂ/ਹੋ/ਹੈ/ਹਨ","explain":"ਮੈਂ ਹਾਂ (I am), ਤੂੰ ਹੈਂ (you-intimate are), ਉਹ ਹੈ (he/she is), ਤੁਸੀਂ ਹੋ (you-formal are)!","pattern":"ਮੈਂ ਹਾਂ · ਤੂੰ ਹੈਂ · ਉਹ ਹੈ · ਤੁਸੀਂ ਹੋ","examples":[{"t":"ਤੁਸੀਂ ਕਿਵੇਂ ਹੋ?","r":"tusīn kiven ho?","en":"How are you? (formal)"},{"t":"ਮੈਂ ਠੀਕ ਹਾਂ!","r":"main ṭhīk hān!","en":"I'm fine!"},{"t":"ਤੁਹਾਡਾ ਨਾਂ ਕੀ ਹੈ?","r":"tuhāḍā nān kī hai?","en":"What is your name?"}],"mistakes":["Saying ਮੈਂ ਹੋ — ਮੈਂ takes ਹਾਂ!","Saying ਤੁਸੀਂ ਹੈ — ਤੁਸੀਂ takes ਹੋ!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ਅਰਜੁਨ","t":"ਤੁਹਾਡਾ ਨਾਂ ਕੀ ਹੈ?","r":"tuhāḍā nān kī hai?","en":"What is your name?"},{"sp":"ਸਿਮਰਨ","t":"ਮੇਰਾ ਨਾਂ ਸਿਮਰਨ ਹੈ। ਤੁਸੀਂ ਕਿਵੇਂ ਹੋ?","r":"merā nān Simran hai. tusīn kiven ho?","en":"My name is Simran. How are you?"},{"sp":"ਅਰਜੁਨ","t":"ਮੈਂ ਠੀਕ ਹਾਂ! ਤੇ ਤੁਸੀਂ?","r":"main ṭhīk hān! te tusīn?","en":"I'm fine! And you?"},{"sp":"ਸਿਮਰਨ","t":"ਮੈਂ ਵੀ ਠੀਕ ਹਾਂ!","r":"main vī ṭhīk hān!","en":"I'm fine too!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: How are you? (formal)","answer":"ਤੁਸੀਂ ਕਿਵੇਂ ਹੋ"},{"type":"fill","q":"ਮੈਂ ___ ਹਾਂ! (fine)","answer":"ਠੀਕ"},{"type":"choose","q":"ਮੈਂ takes…","options":["ਹੋ","ਹਾਂ","ਹੈਂ","ਹੈ"],"answer":"ਹਾਂ"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: ਹੋ / ਕਿਵੇਂ / ਤੁਸੀਂ","answer":"ਤੁਸੀਂ ਕਿਵੇਂ ਹੋ"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: ਤੁਸੀਂ ਕਿਵੇਂ ਹੋ?","answer":"ਤੁਸੀਂ ਕਿਵੇਂ ਹੋ?"}],"quiz":[{"q":"ਤੁਹਾਡਾ ਨਾਂ ਕੀ ਹੈ? asks…","options":["my name","your name","his name","no name"],"answer":1,"why":"ਤੁਹਾਡਾ ਨਾਂ = your name."},{"q":"ਮੈਂ ਠੀਕ ਹਾਂ means…","options":["not well","I'm fine","so-so","busy"],"answer":1,"why":"ਠੀਕ = fine/okay."},{"q":"ਤੇ ਤੁਸੀਂ? means…","options":["who are you","and you?","where are you","why you"],"answer":1,"why":"ਤੇ = and."},{"q":"ਉਹ takes…","options":["ਹਾਂ","ਹੋ","ਹੈ","ਹਨ"],"answer":2,"why":"ਉਹ + ਹੈ."},{"q":"ਕਿਰਪਾ ਕਰਕੇ means…","options":["thanks","please","sorry","hello"],"answer":1,"why":"ਕਿਰਪਾ ਕਰਕੇ = please."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"BE-forms worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Punjabi.","items":["I","you (formal)","name"],"key":["ਮੈਂ","ਤੁਸੀਂ","ਨਾਂ"]},{"instruction":"Match ਹਾਂ/ਹੋ/ਹੈ/ਹਨ.","items":["How are you? (formal)","I'm fine!","What is your name?"],"key":["ਤੁਸੀਂ ਕਿਵੇਂ ਹੋ","ਮੈਂ ਠੀਕ ਹਾਂ","ਤੁਹਾਡਾ ਨਾਂ ਕੀ ਹੈ"]},{"instruction":"Answer.","items":["And you?","I'm fine too!"],"key":["ਤੇ ਤੁਸੀਂ","ਮੈਂ ਵੀ ਠੀਕ ਹਾਂ"]}]}}]},{"id":"A1-U2","title":"ਹੈ and plurals","lessons":[{"id":"A1-U2-L1","title":"ਹੈ and ਇਹ/ਉਹ","learn":"Point! ਇਹ (this), ਉਹ (that). ਇਹ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਹੈ = This is a book. Not: ਨਹੀਂ — verb LAST: ਇਹ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੈ! Adjectives agree: ਵੱਡਾ ਮੁੰਡਾ (big boy), ਵੱਡੀ ਕੁੜੀ (big girl)!","vocab":[{"t":"ਇਹ","r":"ih","en":"this","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"ਉਹ","r":"uh","en":"that / he / she","pos":"pronoun"},{"t":"ਕਿਤਾਬ","r":"kitāb","en":"book (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ਸਕੂਲ","r":"sakūl","en":"school (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ਗੱਡੀ","r":"gaḍḍī","en":"car (f)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ਵੱਡਾ","r":"vaḍḍā","en":"big (m)","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"ਛੋਟਾ","r":"chhoṭā","en":"small (m)","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"ਘਰ","r":"ghar","en":"house (m)","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"ਇਹXਹੈ · ਨਹੀਂ LAST · ਵੱਡਾ/ਵੱਡੀ","explain":"ਇਹ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਹੈ (this is a book), ਉਹ ਘਰ ਹੈ (that is a house). Negative: ਇਹ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੈ — ਨਹੀਂ before ਹੈ! ਵੱਡਾ (m), ਵੱਡੀ (f)!","pattern":"ਇਹ/ਉਹ + X + ਹੈ · ਨਹੀਂ before ਹੈ","examples":[{"t":"ਇਹ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਹੈ।","r":"ih kitāb hai.","en":"This is a book."},{"t":"ਉਹ ਵੱਡਾ ਘਰ ਹੈ।","r":"uh vaḍḍā ghar hai.","en":"That is a big house."},{"t":"ਇਹ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੈ।","r":"ih kitāb nahīn hai.","en":"This is not a book."}],"mistakes":["Saying ਨਹੀਂ ਹੈ ਕਿਤਾਬ — order: X + ਨਹੀਂ + ਹੈ!","Saying ਵੱਡੀ ਮੁੰਡਾ — boys take ਵੱਡਾ!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ਸਿਮਰਨ","t":"ਇਹ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਹੈ?","r":"ih kitāb hai?","en":"Is this a book?"},{"sp":"ਅਰਜੁਨ","t":"ਹਾਂ, ਇਹ ਵੱਡੀ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਹੈ।","r":"hān, ih vaḍḍī kitāb hai.","en":"Yes, this is a big book."},{"sp":"ਸਿਮਰਨ","t":"ਉਹ ਸਕੂਲ ਹੈ?","r":"uh sakūl hai?","en":"Is that a school?"},{"sp":"ਅਰਜੁਨ","t":"ਹਾਂ!","r":"hān!","en":"Yes!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: This is a book","answer":"ਇਹ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਹੈ"},{"type":"fill","q":"___ ਸਕੂਲ ਹੈ। (That)","answer":"ਉਹ"},{"type":"choose","q":"'This is not a book' is…","options":["ਇਹ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਹੈ","ਇਹ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੈ","ਇਹ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਹੈ","ਇਹ ਹੈ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਿਤਾਬ"],"answer":"ਇਹ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੈ"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: ਹੈ / ਕਿਤਾਬ / ਇਹ","answer":"ਇਹ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਹੈ"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: ਇਹ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਹੈ।","answer":"ਇਹ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਹੈ।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"ਉਹ means…","options":["this","that / he / she","here","what"],"answer":1,"why":"ਉਹ = that + he/she."},{"q":"ਨਹੀਂ goes…","options":["first","before ਹੈ","after ਹੈ","nowhere"],"answer":1,"why":"X + ਨਹੀਂ + ਹੈ."},{"q":"ਵੱਡੀ ਕਿਤਾਬ matches because…","options":["both big","both feminine","both plural","both new"],"answer":1,"why":"ਕਿਤਾਬ (f) + ਵੱਡੀ (f)."},{"q":"ਗੱਡੀ is…","options":["masculine","feminine","plural","verb"],"answer":1,"why":"ਗੱਡੀ = feminine."},{"q":"ਘਰ is…","options":["masculine","feminine","plural","verb"],"answer":0,"why":"ਘਰ = masculine."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Pointing worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Punjabi.","items":["this","that","book"],"key":["ਇਹ","ਉਹ","ਕਿਤਾਬ"]},{"instruction":"Point and name.","items":["This is a book","That is a school","This is not a book"],"key":["ਇਹ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਹੈ","ਉਹ ਸਕੂਲ ਹੈ","ਇਹ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਨਹੀਂ ਹੈ"]},{"instruction":"Agree gender.","items":["a big book (f)","a big house (m)"],"key":["ਵੱਡੀ ਕਿਤਾਬ","ਵੱਡਾ ਘਰ"]}]}},{"id":"A1-U2-L2","title":"Plurals: ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ","learn":"Plurals shift! ਕਿਤਾਬ → ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ (books), ਮੁੰਡਾ → ਮੁੰਡੇ (boys), ਕੁੜੀ → ਕੁੜੀਆਂ (girls). Feminine -ੀ → -ਈਆਂ! ਕਿੰਨੇ? (how many-m), ਕਿੰਨੀਆਂ? (how many-f)!","vocab":[{"t":"ਇੱਕ","r":"ikk","en":"one","pos":"number"},{"t":"ਦੋ","r":"do","en":"two","pos":"number"},{"t":"ਤਿੰਨ","r":"tinn","en":"three","pos":"number"},{"t":"ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ","r":"kitābān","en":"books","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ਲੋਕ","r":"lok","en":"people","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ਬਹੁਤ","r":"bahut","en":"many / very","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"ਥੋੜ੍ਹਾ","r":"thoṛhā","en":"a little","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"ਕਿੰਨੇ","r":"kinne","en":"how many (m)","pos":"phrase"}],"grammar":{"title":"-ਆਂ/-ਏ/-ਈਆਂ plurals","explain":"ਕਿਤਾਬ→ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ, ਮੁੰਡਾ→ਮੁੰਡੇ, ਕੁੜੀ→ਕੁੜੀਆਂ, ਘਰ→ਘਰ (same!). ਕਿੰਨੇ ਮੁੰਡੇ? (how many boys?), ਕਿੰਨੀਆਂ ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ? (how many books?)!","pattern":"-ਆਂ (f) · -ਏ (m -ਾ) · -ਈਆਂ (f -ੀ)","examples":[{"t":"ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ ਹਨ।","r":"mere kol kitābān han.","en":"I have books."},{"t":"ਕਿੰਨੇ ਮੁੰਡੇ?","r":"kinne munḍe?","en":"How many boys?"},{"t":"ਤਿੰਨ ਕੁੜੀਆਂ।","r":"tinn kuṛīān.","en":"Three girls."}],"mistakes":["Saying ਕਿਤਾਬੋਂ for subject — subjects: ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ!","Saying ਕਿੰਨੇ ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ — feminine: ਕਿੰਨੀਆਂ!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ਅਰਜੁਨ","t":"ਕਿੰਨੀਆਂ ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ ਹਨ?","r":"kinnīān kitābān han?","en":"How many books?"},{"sp":"ਸਿਮਰਨ","t":"ਤਿੰਨ ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ!","r":"tinn kitābān!","en":"Three books!"},{"sp":"ਅਰਜੁਨ","t":"ਬਹੁਤ ਵਧੀਆ!","r":"bahut vadhīā!","en":"Very good!"},{"sp":"ਸਿਮਰਨ","t":"ਸ਼ੁਕਰੀਆ!","r":"shukrīā!","en":"Thanks!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: Three books!","answer":"ਤਿੰਨ ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ"},{"type":"fill","q":"___ ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ ਹਨ? (How many, f)","answer":"ਕਿੰਨੀਆਂ"},{"type":"choose","q":"ਕੁੜੀ → plural is…","options":["ਕੁੜੀਏ","ਕੁੜੀਆਂ","ਕੁੜੀਆਂਨੂੰ","ਕੁੜੇ"],"answer":"ਕੁੜੀਆਂ"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ / ਤਿੰਨ","answer":"ਤਿੰਨ ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: ਤਿੰਨ ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ!","answer":"ਤਿੰਨ ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"ਕਿਤਾਬ → plural is…","options":["ਕਿਤਾਬੇ","ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ","ਕਿਤਾਬੋਂ","ਕਿਤਾਬਾ"],"answer":1,"why":"ਕਿਤਾਬ→ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ."},{"q":"ਮੁੰਡਾ → plural is…","options":["ਮੁੰਡੇ","ਮੁੰਡੇਂ","ਮੁੰਡਿਆਂ","ਮੁੰਡਾ"],"answer":0,"why":"-ਾ → -ੇ: ਮੁੰਡੇ."},{"q":"ਕਿੰਨੀਆਂ is for…","options":["masculine","feminine","plural-only","formal"],"answer":1,"why":"ਕਿੰਨੀਆਂ ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ."},{"q":"ਬਹੁਤ means…","options":["few","many / very","all","some"],"answer":1,"why":"ਬਹੁਤ = many/very."},{"q":"ਲੋਕ means…","options":["boys","people","books","girls"],"answer":1,"why":"ਲੋਕ = people."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Plurals worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Punjabi.","items":["books","people","many"],"key":["ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ","ਲੋਕ","ਬਹੁਤ"]},{"instruction":"Make plurals.","items":["ਕਿਤਾਬ → …","ਮੁੰਡਾ → …","ਕੁੜੀ → …"],"key":["ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ","ਮੁੰਡੇ","ਕੁੜੀਆਂ"]},{"instruction":"Count.","items":["How many books? (f)","Three books!"],"key":["ਕਿੰਨੀਆਂ ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ ਹਨ","ਤਿੰਨ ਕਿਤਾਬਾਂ"]}]}}]},{"id":"A1-U3","title":"First verbs","lessons":[{"id":"A1-U3-L1","title":"Present: ਖਾਂਦਾ ਹਾਂ / ਖਾ ਰਿਹਾ ਹਾਂ","learn":"Two presents! ਖਾਂਦਾ ਹਾਂ = I eat (habit). ਖਾ ਰਿਹਾ ਹਾਂ = I am eating (NOW). -ਦਾ habitual, -ਰਿਹਾ continuous! Verbs agree GENDER: boy ਖਾਂਦਾ, girl ਖਾਂਦੀ!","vocab":[{"t":"ਖਾਣਾ","r":"khāṇā","en":"to eat","pos":"verb"},{"t":"ਪੀਣਾ","r":"pīṇā","en":"to drink","pos":"verb"},{"t":"ਪੜ੍ਹਨਾ","r":"paṛhnā","en":"to read / study","pos":"verb"},{"t":"ਲਿਖਣਾ","r":"likhṇā","en":"to write","pos":"verb"},{"t":"ਬੋਲਣਾ","r":"bolṇā","en":"to speak","pos":"verb"},{"t":"ਸਿੱਖਣਾ","r":"sikkhaṇā","en":"to learn","pos":"verb"},{"t":"ਕੰਮ ਕਰਨਾ","r":"kamm karnā","en":"to work","pos":"verb"},{"t":"ਰਹਿਣਾ","r":"rahiṇā","en":"to live / stay","pos":"verb"}],"grammar":{"title":"-ਦਾ ਹਾਂ (habit) · -ਰਿਹਾ ਹਾਂ (now)","explain":"ਮੈਂ ਖਾਂਦਾ ਹਾਂ (I eat — boy), ਮੈਂ ਖਾਂਦੀ ਹਾਂ (I eat — girl). ਮੈਂ ਖਾ ਰਿਹਾ ਹਾਂ (I am eating — boy), ਮੈਂ ਖਾ ਰਹੀ ਹਾਂ (girl). Root + ਦਾ/ਰਿਹਾ + ਹਾਂ!","pattern":"root + ਦਾ/ਦੀ + ਹਾਂ · root + ਰਿਹਾ/ਰਹੀ + ਹਾਂ","examples":[{"t":"ਮੈਂ ਪੰਜਾਬੀ ਬੋਲਦਾ ਹਾਂ।","r":"main Panjābī boldā hān.","en":"I speak Punjabi. (boy)"},{"t":"ਮੈਂ ਖਾ ਰਹੀ ਹਾਂ।","r":"main khā rahī hān.","en":"I am eating. (girl)"},{"t":"ਉਹ ਪੜ੍ਹਦਾ ਹੈ।","r":"uh paṛhdā hai.","en":"He reads."}],"mistakes":["Girls saying ਖਾਂਦਾ ਹਾਂ — girls say ਖਾਂਦੀ ਹਾਂ!","Saying ਖਾ ਰਿਹਾ ਹਾਂ for habits — habits: ਖਾਂਦਾ ਹਾਂ!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ਸਿਮਰਨ","t":"ਕੀ ਤੁਸੀਂ ਅੰਗਰੇਜ਼ੀ ਬੋਲਦੇ ਹੋ?","r":"kī tusīn angrezī bolde ho?","en":"Do you speak English? (formal)"},{"sp":"ਅਰਜੁਨ","t":"ਹਾਂ, ਬੋਲਦਾ ਹਾਂ! ਤੇ ਤੁਸੀਂ?","r":"hān, boldā hān! te tusīn?","en":"Yes, I speak! (boy) And you?"},{"sp":"ਸਿਮਰਨ","t":"ਮੈਂ ਪੰਜਾਬੀ ਬੋਲਦੀ ਹਾਂ!","r":"main Panjābī boldī hān!","en":"I speak Punjabi! (girl)"},{"sp":"ਅਰਜੁਨ","t":"ਬਹੁਤ ਵਧੀਆ!","r":"bahut vadhīā!","en":"Excellent!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say (boy): I speak Punjabi","answer":"ਮੈਂ ਪੰਜਾਬੀ ਬੋਲਦਾ ਹਾਂ"},{"type":"fill","q":"ਮੈਂ ਖਾ ___ ਹਾਂ। (am eating, girl)","answer":"ਰਹੀ"},{"type":"choose","q":"A girl says 'I eat'…","options":["ਮੈਂ ਖਾਂਦਾ ਹਾਂ","ਮੈਂ ਖਾਂਦੀ ਹਾਂ","ਮੈਂ ਖਾਂਦੇ ਹਾਂ","ਮੈਂ ਖਾਂਦੋ ਹਾਂ"],"answer":"ਮੈਂ ਖਾਂਦੀ ਹਾਂ"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: ਹਾਂ / ਬੋਲਦਾ / ਪੰਜਾਬੀ / ਮੈਂ","answer":"ਮੈਂ ਪੰਜਾਬੀ ਬੋਲਦਾ ਹਾਂ"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: ਮੈਂ ਪੰਜਾਬੀ ਬੋਲਦੀ ਹਾਂ।","answer":"ਮੈਂ ਪੰਜਾਬੀ ਬੋਲਦੀ ਹਾਂ।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"ਖਾਂਦੀ ਹਾਂ is spoken by…","options":["boys","girls","elders","everyone"],"answer":1,"why":"-ਦੀ = feminine."},{"q":"ਖਾ ਰਿਹਾ ਹਾਂ means…","options":["I eat (habit)","I am eating","I ate","I will eat"],"answer":1,"why":"ਰਿਹਾ = continuous now."},{"q":"ਉਹ ਪੜ੍ਹਦਾ ਹੈ means…","options":["I read","he reads","you read","they read"],"answer":1,"why":"ਉਹ + ਦਾ + ਹੈ."},{"q":"ਤੁਸੀਂ ਬੋਲਦੇ ਹੋ uses -ਦੇ because…","options":["past","formal/plural","feminine","future"],"answer":1,"why":"ਤੁਸੀਂ = plural-form even solo!"},{"q":"ਸਿੱਖਣਾ means…","options":["to teach","to learn","to read","to forget"],"answer":1,"why":"ਸਿੱਖਣਾ = to learn."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Present verbs worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Punjabi.","items":["to eat","to speak","to learn"],"key":["ਖਾਣਾ","ਬੋਲਣਾ","ਸਿੱਖਣਾ"]},{"instruction":"Agree gender.","items":["I speak Punjabi (boy)","I speak Punjabi (girl)","He reads"],"key":["ਮੈਂ ਪੰਜਾਬੀ ਬੋਲਦਾ ਹਾਂ","ਮੈਂ ਪੰਜਾਬੀ ਬੋਲਦੀ ਹਾਂ","ਉਹ ਪੜ੍ਹਦਾ ਹੈ"]},{"instruction":"Ask.","items":["Do you speak English? (formal)","Excellent!"],"key":["ਕੀ ਤੁਸੀਂ ਅੰਗਰੇਜ਼ੀ ਬੋਲਦੇ ਹੋ","ਬਹੁਤ ਵਧੀਆ"]}]}},{"id":"A1-U3-L2","title":"ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ ਹੈ + ਵਿੱਚ/ਤੇ","learn":"HAVE = ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ…ਹੈ! ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਹੈ (I have a book). No-have: ਨਹੀਂ ਹੈ! Places: ਵਿੱਚ (in), ਤੇ (on): ਕਿਤਾਬ ਮੇਜ਼ ਤੇ ਹੈ (the book is on the table)!","vocab":[{"t":"ਕੋਲ","r":"kol","en":"near / have (with)","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"ਹੈ","r":"hai","en":"is","pos":"verb"},{"t":"ਪਾਣੀ","r":"pāṇī","en":"water (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ਘਰ","r":"ghar","en":"house","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ਪੈਸੇ","r":"paise","en":"money","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ਦੋਸਤ","r":"dost","en":"friend","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ਸਮਾਂ","r":"samān","en":"time (m)","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ਰੋਟੀ","r":"roṭī","en":"bread (f)","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ X ਹੈ · ਵਿੱਚ/ਤੇ","explain":"ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਹੈ (I have a book), ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਕੋਲ ਪਾਣੀ ਹੈ? (do you have water?), ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ ਪੈਸੇ ਨਹੀਂ ਹਨ (no money). ਵਿੱਚ = in, ਤੇ = on!","pattern":"ਮੇਰੇ/ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਕੋਲ + X + ਹੈ · ਵਿੱਚ/ਤੇ","examples":[{"t":"ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਹੈ।","r":"mere kol kitāb hai.","en":"I have a book."},{"t":"ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਕੋਲ ਪਾਣੀ ਹੈ?","r":"tuhāḍe kol pāṇī hai?","en":"Do you have water?"},{"t":"ਕਿਤਾਬ ਮੇਜ਼ ਤੇ ਹੈ।","r":"kitāb mez te hai.","en":"The book is on the table."}],"mistakes":["Saying ਮੈਂ ਰੱਖਦਾ ਹਾਂ for have — have: ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ!","Saying ਵਿੱਚ for ON — on = ਤੇ!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ਅਰਜੁਨ","t":"ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਕੋਲ ਪਾਣੀ ਹੈ?","r":"tuhāḍe kol pāṇī hai?","en":"Do you have water?"},{"sp":"ਸਿਮਰਨ","t":"ਹਾਂ, ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ ਪਾਣੀ ਤੇ ਰੋਟੀ ਹੈ।","r":"hān, mere kol pāṇī te roṭī hai.","en":"Yes, I have water and bread."},{"sp":"ਅਰਜੁਨ","t":"ਸ਼ੁਕਰੀਆ! ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ ਪੈਸੇ ਨਹੀਂ ਹਨ।","r":"shukrīā! mere kol paise nahīn han.","en":"Thanks! I have no money."},{"sp":"ਸਿਮਰਨ","t":"ਕੋਈ ਗੱਲ ਨਹੀਂ!","r":"koī gall nahīn!","en":"No problem!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I have a book","answer":"ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਹੈ"},{"type":"fill","q":"ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ ਪੈਸੇ ___ ਹਨ। (no)","answer":"ਨਹੀਂ"},{"type":"choose","q":"'The book is on the table' is…","options":["ਕਿਤਾਬ ਮੇਜ਼ ਵਿੱਚ ਹੈ","ਕਿਤਾਬ ਮੇਜ਼ ਤੇ ਹੈ","ਕਿਤਾਬ ਮੇਜ਼ ਨੂੰ ਹੈ","ਕਿਤਾਬ ਮੇਜ਼ ਤੋਂ ਹੈ"],"answer":"ਕਿਤਾਬ ਮੇਜ਼ ਤੇ ਹੈ"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: ਹੈ / ਕਿਤਾਬ / ਕੋਲ / ਮੇਰੇ","answer":"ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਹੈ"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ ਪਾਣੀ ਤੇ ਰੋਟੀ ਹੈ।","answer":"ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ ਪਾਣੀ ਤੇ ਰੋਟੀ ਹੈ।"}],"quiz":[{"q":"ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ ਕਿਤਾਬ ਹੈ means…","options":["I want a book","I have a book","I read a book","I see a book"],"answer":1,"why":"ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ = I have."},{"q":"ਤੇ means…","options":["in","on","to","from"],"answer":1,"why":"ਮੇਜ਼ ਤੇ = on the table."},{"q":"ਪੈਸੇ means…","options":["books","money","bread","water"],"answer":1,"why":"ਪੈਸੇ = money."},{"q":"ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਕੋਲ ਪਾਣੀ ਹੈ? means…","options":["Are you here?","Do you have water?","Do you want?","Where is water?"],"answer":1,"why":"ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਕੋਲ = you have."},{"q":"ਰੋਟੀ means…","options":["water","bread","rice","milk"],"answer":1,"why":"ਰੋਟੀ = flatbread."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Punjabi.","items":["I have (near me)","money","friend"],"key":["ਮੇਰੇ ਕੋਲ","ਪੈਸੇ","ਦੋਸਤ"]},{"instruction":"Have things.","items":["I have a book","Do you 